Generation:

.EX
huihui_ai/granite4.1-abliterated:3b
.EE

Embeddings:

.EX
nomic-embed-text
.EE

Both run remotely on the Richmack Ollama server.

.SH SECURITY

RichmackOS prefers deterministic Linux tools when possible.

Scanning does not automatically move or delete files.

Duplicate detection does not delete files.

Stored shell skills require confirmation before execution.

The Ollama API should only be exposed to trusted systems on the local network.

