.SH ORGANIZATION LOGGING AND UNDO

.TP
.B richmack organize --logs
List successful organization move logs.

Logs are stored under:

.EX
~/.richmackos/organize-logs/
.EE

.TP
.B richmack organize --undo-last
Reverse the most recent successful organization run.

RichmackOS first verifies that all destination files still exist and that
none of the original source paths are occupied.

The user must type:

.EX
UNDO
.EE

before restoration occurs.

After successful restoration, the move log is renamed with a
.B .undone
extension.

