.B /quit
exits YouTube Chat.


.SH YOUTUBE CHANNEL-WIDE ANALYSIS

A question referring to multiple videos is analyzed per-video before final
synthesis.

Example:

.EX
richmack youtube chat danny-jones

youtube> what are the main topics across the latest videos?
.EE

Conceptually:

.EX
video 1 -> analysis
video 2 -> analysis
video 3 -> analysis
video 4 -> analysis
video 5 -> analysis
             |
             v
         synthesis
.EE


.SH YOUTUBE FOLLOW-UP MEMORY

RichmackOS can retain the source video after a channel-wide comparison.

Example:

.EX
youtube> what is the most unusual claim discussed?

youtube> what else did they say about it?
.EE

A clearly new subject may route to another episode.


.SH YOUTUBE CLAIM ATTRIBUTION

Extraordinary, historical, conspiracy, paranormal, scientific, or disputed
claims should remain attributed to the source speaker.

For example:

.EX
Gary Wayne claims...
The guest alleges...
Smith describes experiencing...
.EE

RichmackOS should not silently convert a guest assertion into an independently
verified fact.


.SH YOUTUBE ASK

Ask a channel-scoped RAG question:

.EX
richmack youtube ask \
    fireship \
    "What programming topics were discussed?"
.EE

Ask only the newest transcript:

.EX
richmack youtube ask \
    fireship \
    --latest \
    "What did this video discuss?"
.EE


.SH YOUTUBE SUMMARIZE

Summarize one channel:

.EX
richmack youtube summarize \
    tim-ferriss \
    --limit 3
.EE

Summarize all channels:

.EX
richmack youtube summarize \
    --all \
    --limit 3
.EE

Generate a combined briefing:

.EX
richmack youtube summarize \
    --all \
    --limit 3 \
    --combined
.EE


.SH YOUTUBE WORKFLOW

Recommended workflow:

.EX
1. Add channels

   richmack youtube add-channel KEY "NAME" URL

2. Sync recent videos

   richmack youtube sync --limit 3

3. Verify knowledge

   richmack youtube knowledge status

4. Inspect videos

   richmack youtube knowledge videos CHANNEL

5. Inspect topics

   richmack youtube knowledge topics CHANNEL

6. Open chat

   richmack youtube chat CHANNEL

7. Ask a transcript question

   what is the 4x4 protocol?

8. Inspect evidence

   /sources

9. Ask a channel-wide question

   what are the main topics across the latest videos?

10. Generate combined summaries

   richmack youtube summarize --all --limit 3 --combined
.EE


.SH YOUTUBE EXAMPLES

Tim Ferriss:

.EX
richmack youtube chat tim-ferriss

youtube> what is the 4x4 protocol?
youtube> what else is mentioned?
youtube> tell me more about AI predictions
youtube> /sources
.EE

Danny Jones:

.EX
richmack youtube chat danny-jones

youtube> what are the main topics across the latest videos?
youtube> what is the most unusual claim discussed?
youtube> what else did they say about it?
youtube> tell me what they said about knights templar
youtube> /sources
.EE


