.SH YOUTUBE DESIGN PRINCIPLES

The subsystem emphasizes:

.EX
source isolation
video isolation
transcript-first retrieval
explicit evidence
per-video analysis
small-model-friendly prompts
claim attribution
persistent local knowledge
.EE


